      <Properties>
        <Configuration>
          <Text>RetailAnalyticsAdvancedML — exercises full Alteryx Designer surface: Data prep (Auto Field, Data Cleansing, Record ID, Filter), Joins (Join x2, Find Replace, Append Fields), Parsing (DateTime, RegEx, Text-to-Columns), Multi-Row + Multi-Field Formulas, Imputation, Fuzzy Match + Make Group, Spatial (Create Points, Buffer, Find Nearest, Spatial Match), Aggregation (Summarize, Count Records, Running Total, Weighted Average, Tile, Cross Tab, Transpose), Sampling (Random %Sample, Oversample, Create Samples), Predictive (Linear Regression, Score), Time Series (TS Plot, ARIMA), Developer (Cache, Test, Message, Block Until Done), Macro reference, Containers, Comments, Generate Rows, Union, Unique, Sort, Sample, Select, Multiple CSV Outputs.</Text>
          <Font name="Tahoma" size="9" style="0" />
          <TextColor name="Black" />
          <FillColor r="245" g="245" b="220" />
          <Shape shape="0" />
          <Justification value="Left" />
        </Configuration>
        <Annotation DisplayMode="0" />
      </Properties>
    </Node>

